id=netstats-fix
name=Network Stats Fix for GSI
version=v14
versionCode=14
author=Hirbod-JORFlint
description=Universal fix for broken traffic indicator on Android GSIs. Includes: AIDL metadata support (getInterfaceVersion/Hash), enhanced binder proxy v6.0, netstats XML file injection, comprehensive SELinux policy, per-device sepolicy handling, watchdog monitoring. Handles system, system_axion, system_infinity variants. Safe for all devices - no boot loops.
